    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατετραίνω</span></b> , fut. (
			Ion.
		) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τετρανέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.), or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τρήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					<u>Poliorc.</u>
					148.3
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έτρησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.370b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				26
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τρήσαιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.708
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τρηθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					321.13
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τετρηυένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					<u>Poliorc.</u>
					152.2
				</span></i>
			:—<i>bore through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠόν</span> Plu.l.c.:—
				Med.
			, aor., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτα διετετρήνατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατελ-διατιτραίνω</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.17.9
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); also (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατίτρημι</span>) part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατιτράντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					69.12
				</span></i>
			, impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διετίτρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Pun.</u>
					122
				</span></i>
			:—late pres.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατιτράω</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>: impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διετίτρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Hisp.</u>
					77
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διετίτρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
